WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:26.000
[Instrumental Intro]

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:31.500
Tracing the copper across the floor

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:37.500
Looking for a frequency we knew before

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.200
Twenty-five years in a vacuum tube

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:49.000
Watching the shadows shift and move

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:55.000
Every word that we left unsaid

00:00:55.500 --> 00:01:00.800
Is a phantom signal inside my head

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:06.500
Bouncing off a satellite in the cold

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:12.500
A story that never grew old

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:16.200
We're just echoes in the wire

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:19.200
Starlight escaping from the fire

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:22.000
Hold on to the memory

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:25.000
Of who we used to be

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:27.800
When the cosmos is standing still

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:30.800
I know we always will

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:33.800
Leave a resonance in the sound

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:39.500
Long after we leave the ground

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:46.500
[Instrumental Interlude]

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:52.200
Put your ear up against the glass

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:58.000
Watch the constellations slowly pass

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:04.000
We built a shelter out of magnetic tape

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:09.800
A quiet place for our great escape

00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:13.000
You don't have to shout to be heard out here

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:15.800
The lightest whisper is crystal clear

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:19.000
We're just echoes in the wire

